00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:22.200
enough up in the altitude where, uh, control&nbsp;
surfaces, like flap flaps and fins don't work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.200
anymore. There's not enough drag, there's&nbsp;
